     "stop_timestamp": "2026-03-16T00:30:00.000000Z",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "doing 2025 taxes. grad student at VT. i got a W-2 for my GRA, and a 1098-T. tuition was covered by a waiver. do i put the 1098-T in or skip it. not looking for official advice just how it works",
     "citations": []
    }
   ],
   "sender": "human",
   "index": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-03-16T00:30:00.000000Z",
   "updated_at": "2026-03-16T00:30:00.000000Z",
   "truncated": false,
